    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats or weight loss; energy back to normal</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No vision change; eye examination last year</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No mouth sores</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Normal bowel movements; no blood, urgency or pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Light periods with the IUD; no urinary symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Breast</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lump or nipple discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No joint pain or swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No rash or itching; no changing moles</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache or numbness</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>Cold intolerance gone; no thirst</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-9 2; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>13 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

